- [Interface and settings](https://www.sketch.com/docs/interface-and-settings/): We’ve designed Sketch’s interface to show what you need, when you need it — leaving you to concentrate on what matters most: your creative process.
In this section you’ll find out where to find every single tool and setting in the Mac and web app UI, as well as document settings and details on how to use plugins.
- [The Mac app interface](https://www.sketch.com/docs/interface-and-settings/the-mac-app-interface/): Get to know the Sketch interface like the back of your hand. Learn everything you need to know to take your designs to the next level.
