- [Document Libraries](https://www.sketch.com/docs/interface-and-settings/document-settings/document-libraries/): With Document Libraries, you can enable a Library for a specific document rather than having it available for every document. This is helpful to keep those Components you really need at hand instead of having to go through every Component in every single Library you have installed.
