Here you’ll discover how to accelerate collaborative design and share your work with ease, from the smallest component to entire projects.
- [Real-time collaboration](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/real-time-collaboration/): With real-time collaboration, you can work together on the same document, see everyone’s changes instantly, and never have to wonder about whether you’re editing the right version of a document again.
- [Sharing and viewing documents](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/sharing-and-viewing-documents/): Learn how to share your designs and give the right permissions to other people, whether they are part of your Workspace or not. Not ready to share your work yet? Save it to [My Drafts](/docs/getting-started/saving-and-managing-documents/#managing-documents-in-my-drafts) first.
- [Sharing a document via link or email](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/sharing-and-viewing-documents/sharing-a-document/): Share Sketch documents by copying a link or inviting collaborators via email in the Mac or web app.
