- [Creating starred versions](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/sharing-and-viewing-documents/creating-starred-versions/): With starred versions, you can indicate important updates in a document’s history, set which versions Viewers and Guests can see, and control which versions become Library updates for Editors.
- [Managing share settings](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/sharing-and-viewing-documents/managing-share-settings/): Learn how to share and view documents in Sketch with the help of our step-by-step guides and video tutorials.
- [Previews](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/sharing-and-viewing-documents/previews/): Share specific pages and prototypes from your document using previews.
