- [Document permissions](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/document-permissions/): Learn how to apply document permissions in Sketch with the help of our step-by-step guides and video tutorials.
- [Commenting in documents](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/commenting/): Add, view, resolve, and manage comments across your Sketch documents — and get notified when collaborators reply.
- [Using your Workspace](https://www.sketch.com/docs/sharing-and-collaborating/using-your-workspace/): Your Workspace keeps all your documents together, in sync and available anywhere. From there, you and other Workspace Members can inspect designs, export assets, share feedback, manage Members, invite Guests and much more — and in any browser.
